---
title: Where an announcement goes — spoken here, or a notification
---
%% Verified against the tree on 2026-09-13.
%% The rule (NotificationPolicy.cs): the CHANNEL IS DECIDED BY THE EVENT'S SUBJECT.
%% The chart in front of the trader is spoken; everything else is a system notification.
flowchart TD
    subgraph SRC["Something happened"]
        BAR["A bar closed<br/>NewBarEvent · BackgroundBarAnnouncer · HeadlessChart"]
        LADDER["The narration ladder ran<br/>NarrationScanner → ScanUtterance (one sentence, five clauses at most)"]
        ALERT["An alert fired<br/>AlertOrchestrator · AlertEvaluator"]
        FILL["Money moved — fill, stop, take-profit, rejection, cancel<br/>TradingReconciliationCoordinator · HeadlessOrderWatch"]
        SETUP["A strategy setup armed<br/>SetupSonifier — always prefixed with its symbol"]
    end

    Q1{"NotificationPolicy.IsOnScreen<br/>Is the event's SYMBOL the chart in front of the trader?<br/>(symbol only — timeframe and venue are ignored)"}
    BAR & LADDER & ALERT & FILL & SETUP --> Q1

    Q2{"IUserPresence.IsAppVisible<br/>Is anything being read aloud?<br/>A minimised browser still counts as visible.<br/>A MAUI window hidden to the tray does not."}
    Q1 -->|yes| Q2

    subgraph SPOKEN["Spoken here — never also a notification"]
        AFC["AccessibilityFeedbackCoordinator → SpeechFeedbackRouter"]
        CH["SpeechChannel<br/>Manual — muted by F2 · Event — muted by Shift+F2<br/>OrderEvent — breaks both mutes · Critical — never muted"]
        LIVE["ARIA live region in MainLayout (the ONE announcing channel)<br/>or the server-side voice: Orca over D-Bus, spd-say"]
        AFC --> CH --> LIVE
    end
    Q2 -->|yes| AFC

    Q3{"Events you cannot see → Send me a notification<br/>SettingsKeys.NotifyUnseenEvents — ON by default"}
    Q1 -->|no: another tab, no tab, or no browser| Q3
    Q2 -->|no: hidden to the tray| Q3

    FLOOR{"Bar closes and the ladder only:<br/>is the chart's timeframe at or above the<br/>Shortest timeframe to announce floor?"}
    Q3 -->|on| FLOOR
    Q3 -->|off| DROP["Stays quiet.<br/>Alerts still reach email, Telegram and webhooks; the Journal still records it."]

    subgraph TOAST["A system notification — the notification IS the announcement"]
        DNS["DesktopNotificationService → IDesktopNotifier"]
        OS["DesktopDeliveryPlan<br/>Linux: notify-send, then Orca / spd-say if it did not land<br/>Windows: toast (Action Center)<br/>macOS: terminal-notifier or osascript"]
        DNS --> OS
    end
    FLOOR -->|yes, or not a bar close| DNS
    FLOOR -->|below the floor| DROP

    SNOOZE["Tray: Silence alerts and bar closes for 30 minutes<br/>gates alerts, bar closes, the ladder and the monitor's own reports —<br/>ORDER EVENTS ALWAYS COME THROUGH"]
    DNS --- SNOOZE

    JRN["JournalService — every sentence, whichever way it went (Ctrl+Alt+Shift+J)"]
    LIVE --> JRN
    OS --> JRN

    NOTE["Two things ignore every switch on this page:<br/>errors, and your order outcomes. Missing a stop firing costs real money."]
    FILL --- NOTE
